            id: "engine_zpinch_advanced",
            name: "Z-Pinch Advanced",
            description: "Full-scale Z-pinch fusion engine for crewed interstellar vessels. Multiple plasma channels fire in sequence, providing sustained thrust at 20,000 km/s exhaust velocity. Advanced superconducting magnets contain the fusion plasma without physical contact. The workhorse of the fusion era.",
