        (
            id: "engine_amcat_fusion",
            name: "AM-Cat Fusion",
            description: "Antimatter-catalyzed fusion engine. Milligrams of antiprotons injected into a D+He3 target initiate fusion without massive driver hardware. Exhaust velocity of 30,000 km/s — three times faster than pure fusion drives. The antimatter is a catalyst, not the primary fuel, so consumption is remarkably low.",
