            id: "engine_am_torch",
            name: "Antimatter Torch",
            description: "Direct antimatter annihilation engine. Proton-antiproton pairs annihilate in a magnetic confinement chamber, producing charged pions channeled through a magnetic nozzle at 150,000 km/s. Compact, devastating thrust-to-weight ratio. The pinnacle of reaction-drive technology — but antimatter production remains the bottleneck.",
